			"notes": "# MACtouchMC 1.0.0 Beta 🍏\n\n**The Ultimate Touch Bar Integration for Minecraft 1.21+**\n\nWe are proud to release the first public Beta of MACtouchMC! This mod brings your MacBook's Touch Bar to life with context-aware controls, custom keybindings, and powerful debug tools.\n\n## ✨ Key Features\n*   **Context Aware**: Automatically switches layouts between **Main Menu**, **In-Game**, and **Debug** screens.\n*   **Custom Inputs**: \"Free the F Key\"! Bind **ANY** in-game action (Attack, Jump, Swap Hands) to a custom Touch Bar button with your own icon and color.\n*   **Debug Suite**: One-tap access to useful F3 commands like **Show Hitboxes**, **Chunk Borders**, and **Reload Chunks**.\n*   **Native Performance**: Optimized for Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3) & Intel Macs.\n\n## 🛠️ V2 Stability Improvements\nThis release includes significant polish for the Custom Key system:\n*   ✅ **Stable IDs**: Reordering buttons in the config no longer breaks your keybindings.\n*   ✅ **Smart Inputs**: Fixed \"Sticky Keys\" issue where buttons would get stuck in the pressed state.\n*   ✅ **Localization**: Your custom button names now appear correctly in the Minecraft \"Key Binds\" menu (instead of \"F13\", \"F14\").\n\n## 📦 Installation\n1.  Install **Fabric Loader** for Minecraft 1.21.1.\n2.  Install **Fabric API**, **YetAnotherConfigLib**, and **Mod Menu**.\n3.  Drop `mactouchmc-1.0.0-beta.jar` into your mods folder.\n\n*Enjoy the touch of magic!*"
		}
